
# GORA 2.0 — Savings & Credit Management

GORA 2.0 is a web-based management application for savings groups, members, loans, savings and financial operations.

## Project structure

```text
gora-management-system/
├── README.md
├── gora2/
│   ├── index.html
│   ├── app.js
│   └── styles.css
└── supabase/
    ├── README.md
    └── migrations/
        └── 202611180001_gora20_operational_foundation.sql
```

## Technology

- HTML, CSS and JavaScript
- Supabase authentication
- Supabase PostgreSQL database
- Row Level Security (RLS)

## Setup

1. Configure the Supabase project URL and public publishable/anon key in `gora2/app.js`.
2. Never put a Supabase service-role or secret key in frontend code.
3. Review database migrations before applying them.
4. Configure the required database tables, policies and user roles.
5. Deploy the `gora2` folder using a static web host.

## Important

This release is an application foundation, not a complete production financial system.

Do not use it to process real member funds until transaction posting, approvals, loan calculations, reconciliation and permissions have been fully implemented and tested.
